    "title": "EFV-based regimen not current preferred first-line",
    "message": "Guidelines recommend TDF+3TC+DTG as the preferred first-line regimen for adults. EFV400 is an alternative only when DTG is contraindicated. Patient is on EFV (likely 600mg) for 6 years, virologically suppressed. Guidelines also note EFV can cause persistent CNS toxicity and musculoskeletal symptoms. While the patient is stable, the regimen does not align with current preferred first-line recommendations. No contraindication to DTG is documented.",
